					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: SHAPE DISTRIBUTION\n\nIn this example we use a Linear node with a negative min value in conjuction with a Float2 node to create a collection that distributes the rectangles horizontally across the screen.\nNote that the instance count of the Rectangle only gets updated when the Float2 hits the Move node, Wire does this automatically for you."
					}
				},
